{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act40side_level_act40side_08_end",
  "groupId": "act40side",
  "stageId": "act40side_08",
  "title": "金玉藏心",
  "storyCode": "OR-8",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4821fd00c530ced15d92237128b4e29208db687d8078cb89e9a929b4f23ec439",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "虞澄......你想要的，当年太师案的真相，就是这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "你还有什么想问的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "说了这么多，宁大人倒是只字不提，自己在这一系列事件中的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "......你为什么要派人刺杀刑部尚书？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "虞少卿不是已经有答案了吗？许多年前，你不是指控我在乱局中为求自保，便派人谋害了查案的刑部尚书吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "宁大人倒不必急着这样抹黑自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "其实这个问题也困扰了我很久，顾筌时隔十几年再回到百灶，为何偏偏留在你的家中？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "直到那一次，我在你家看到那个女孩，我的最后一个问题才得到解答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "顾筌九死一生，还是要回到百灶，不只是为了查明当年真相，也是为了找到，自己遗落在百灶的女儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "看来顾筌告诉你的事，似乎也没有那么多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "是啊，剩下的事，都只是我的猜想，要是有不对的地方，宁大人大可笑话我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "我听说，当年太师背负谋逆之罪自尽后，举国哗然，文武百官纷纷表态与太师割席。可是有一个学宫的学生，竟敢当众上门凭吊太师。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "也因此，他撞见了太师被抄家的场面。慌乱中，他只得带走了太师家中一个出生不久的女婴——巧的是，他自己的女儿也刚刚出世。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "他不知所措，带着妻子和两个婴儿想要逃离百灶，可他不过是一个势单力薄的书生，没过多久，就被赶来的禁军抓到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "大概是那位禁军心存恻隐，也是有意为太师保留血脉，放了那书生一条生路，带回了那个书生的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "我不知顾筌该作何想，不过当时的他大概也别无选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "这个孩子落在刑部尚书手中，她的血脉一查便知，可如何处理这个本是局外人的孩子反而成了悬而未决的难题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "就在这个时候，对于刑部尚书过激之举早有不满的宁大人，终于选择铤而走险，派人刺杀了刑部尚书。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "太师案牵连甚广，手上沾满了血的刑部尚书遭人报复似乎也在情理之中，时局既定，真龙便默许这一系列风波以这种方式落下帷幕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "那最后没有解决的问题，也只剩下了那个孩子。从结果来看，她既然被宁大人收养，其中过程，似乎也不难猜。但要说目的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "宁大人，我没记错的话，你也在太师门下读过书，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "......虞澄啊虞澄，你要是不在大理寺为官，你要是不在这狱中，我真不敢想，你这样的心计，还能做出什么事来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "可怕，真可怕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "宁大人过奖了，和顾筌比起来，我不过是个笨人。只是当这大理寺少卿，见过太多人了——见多了，也就懂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "现在想起来，顾筌在百珍宴上为真龙献上那道菜，近乎求死之举，实际上是已经与真相和解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "而他在临死前，没有告诉我真相，却向我透露了太师遗孤的下落——他是希望我查明真相后，也能选择和解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "......可我和解不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "我只能用这种方式，找到那些留下的人、你在乎的人，逼你把真相吐出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "宁大人，细算来，你不能算是个坏人，或许只能算是懦弱......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1617_1",
      "text": "你大可恨我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "再见到那个孩子一面，也算了了我一桩心愿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁述",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1614_1",
      "text": "我会去见陛下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "你......都知道了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "就在刚刚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "我还想问你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "你怎么......还能这么冷静......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "只是一个在心里藏了很多年的猜想......终于被证实了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "就像扎在手心里的一根刺，拔掉了，流了血，也就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "你怎么......不说话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我不知道......怎么会是这样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我该难过吗？还是该生气......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我不知道......我只是觉得脑子一团糟，心里堵得难受......我不知道这一肚子火到底该向谁发！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "现在，是不是该我反过来问你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "煌......你能不能告诉我，顾筌......我的父亲他，是个什么样的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "他......他就是一个笨蛋，书呆子，说谎精！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我讨厌说谎！我见过太多谎言，利欲熏心的谎言、懦弱的谎言、狡诈的谎言......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "可我真的没见过......有人用一辈子去撒一个谎，还把自己的亲女儿弄丢了，把自己也弄丢了，就为了保护一个毫不相干的人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "他怎么......能这么笨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "我想起，以前在书上看过的一个故事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "从前有一个卫兵，守着江边的一所驿站。有一天，他注意到上游发了洪水，想要跑到上游，去提醒那里的人关闭水闸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "可是他跑到一半，发现江水涨得太急，想要关闸已经来不及了，便想立刻赶回下游的村庄，让那里的人赶快疏散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "这个人就这样来回跑着，直到最后他也葬身在这场洪水里，他什么都没能做到，谁也没有救下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "又说这些弯弯绕的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "你说......这个人做的事，听起来是不是很熟悉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我明白！虽然我搞不懂你说的弯弯绕绕的例子，但你在说他的坏话对不对？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "他不是个坏人！他只是......唉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我知道，你当然有理由怨他，可是如果是他主动抛下了你，他又怎么会花这么多时间回来找你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "你怎么反而安慰起我来了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "煌......你是感染者，对吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "你什么时候知道——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "你这个人——是人精吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "抱歉，我没有什么别的意思......我只是在想，这其实本应该是我的命运......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "你在胡说八道什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "你做错了什么事？有什么厄运需要你承担？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我现在活得没什么不好的，有许多伙伴，找到了自己的理想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "而且，明明你过得很惨吧！一个人生活在深宅大院里，孤零零地长大就开心了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "我怎么觉得，你像是在骂我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我不是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "我明白......我明白的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "对啦......我还没有问过，你到底叫什么名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "烛煌......顾烛煌，我爸——是他给我起的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "哈......我都忘了有多久没和别人说过，我原来叫这个名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "好了，这下我真的没有秘密了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "“萤烛之煌，微明可顾”......真像是他会取的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "煌......是不是到现在，我才算真正认识了你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "算......算是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "不对，我还有好多事没给你讲，我还要带你去维多利亚看看呢，我妈——应该说......你亲生母亲，你应该去见见她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "......她还活着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "谁告诉你她死了！她活得好好的，就在维多利亚西边一个小镇里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "等这边的事结束了，我就带你回去见她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "她......她一定很想见你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "好......好好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "你哭什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "我......我没有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "你才是，你干嘛也一副快要哭出来的表情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我就是......高兴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我哪能想到，长这么大了，我还能突然多一个妹妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "哪里有这样的姐妹......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "再说了，谁是妹妹还不一定呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我今天这么难过，你就不能让让我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "你刚刚还安慰我来着......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我就是想说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "从今往后，你就不是孤零零的一个人了，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "唉......真好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "世上百味，到底还是团圆的味道最好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "真是......丢死人了，我跟着哭什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "最后一桩心事，也算了啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "对了，昨天晚上，在禁城中的那位大理寺的官员......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "惊蛰......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "她送我出来的时候，被那个禁军小姑娘截住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "我们现在该怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "这件事，还没结束......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我要去，把原本该做的事做完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宁茵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4172_xingzh_1",
      "text": "你......你打算做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "为所有人......讨一个说法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一百年了。\n终于又回到了这里——棋局开始的地方。\n棋盘结网蒙尘，天元上还留有一颗黑子。\n他伸手拂去了棋盘上的灰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "text": "上哪去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "给人送饭去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "text": "你人走了，这店就不管了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "都什么点了，早打烊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "text": "明天还开吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "......明天开不开，那得看明天的心情，说不准的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "text": "听你这意思，是要散伙了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "text": "行啊，你还欠我半年工钱，结了账就放你走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "嘁......怎么这么小气！给你做了那么多顿员工餐，就抵不过这几个月的债了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "行行行......后厨灶台右手边，从墙角往外数第三块砖，下面藏着我的最后一点零花钱。你拿去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "text": "我跟了你不少年了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "是啊，整整十五年。在跟过我的那些秉烛人里，你算时间最久的，说明我们还是蛮有缘的嘛，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "text": "要是我一直记得我还是司岁台的秉烛人，恐怕也跟不了你这么久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "唉，说实话，我也很多年没记起来我到底是谁了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "倒是没故意记得或者不记得，人也好兽也罢，就觉得这样活着，有滋有味，没什么不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "text": "那你最好永远不要记起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "text": "我怕你想起来自己是谁，反而忘了人的口味。舌头不好使了，这一手厨艺可就荒废了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "唉......我也不想啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "可我总还记得，家里还有这些个不让人省心的哥哥姐姐，他们也是要吃饭的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "何况是最不让人放心的那位......也不知道这么久没见，他到底怎么样了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "text": "你知道，今天去送了这一顿饭，是什么后果？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "唔......应该知道吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "就像灶火边上不能屯棉花，多自然的道理，司岁台当然不乐意让我们开家庭聚会了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "何况是这个节骨眼上......搞不好要是打起来，明天你可能就见不到我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "唉......这些年，我做过许多饭，见了好多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "我想让每一个走进这家店的客人，都能吃上好吃可口的饭，过的日子也都能圆满。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "灶上的酸甜苦辣，心中的喜怒哀乐，世上的悲欢离合，多像同一回事呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "可鲜鳞多刺，海棠无香，世上多的还是遗憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "肚子饿了要吃饭，困了要睡觉......想念亲人了，也总是要去见见的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老姜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1621_1",
      "text": "你......你就真的舍得......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "我还有好多舍不得的东西，可是再舍不得，也不能一直紧抓着不放手呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "老姜......我不在的时候，这家小饭馆能暂时拜托给你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大厨",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "你看着我做了那么久的饭，我会做的菜，你应该也会个七七八八了吧。将来再有客人来，你就替我招呼招呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "“余味居”......这名字起得倒是蛮好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "text": "这人间，余味悠长啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡逻的卫兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1637_1",
      "text": "报告校将，巡防营派出全部兵力，已经在八个城区进行了一轮地毯式的搜查，还是没发现目标。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "已经过去一整天了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "天亮之前，必须——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1637_1",
      "text": "听说你在找我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "何人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "让开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "怎么？现在是打算投案自首？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "正好，也省得我到处找你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "不管你是因百珍宴上的事要抓我，还是因我的身份要抓我......现在都不是时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我现在有要紧事要做，我劝你最好让开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "呵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我还从来没有这么生气过。你要是想拦我，大可试试。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "啧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁军小教头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1615_1",
      "text": "......你到底想去做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_1040_blaze2_1",
      "text": "我要去给真龙，送一碗长寿面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
